{"sourceUrl":"https://gip.csu.edu.cn/info/1046/7900.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.592334+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gip.csu.edu.cn/info/1046/7900.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，地球科学与信息物理学院决定举办</span><span>2025年暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现就开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、活动宗旨</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院研究生招生政策，聆听知名学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>序号</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>招生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>宣讲</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>单位</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>招生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>宣讲</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业（专业代码</span><span>+专业名称+研究方向）</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>地质资源系</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>070900地质学</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>01矿物学、岩石学、矿床学；02地球化学；03古生物学与地层学；04构造地质学；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>081800地质资源与地质工程</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>01矿产普查与勘探；0</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>国土资源信息工程；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>085700资源与环境</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>01地质工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span><span><span>04地质工程（国土资源信息工程）</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>应用地球物理系</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>081800地质资源与地质工程</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>02地球探测与信息技术；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>085700资源与环境</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>0</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>地质工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>地球探测与信息技术</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>地质工程系</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>081800地质资源与地质工程</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>03地质工程；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>085700资源与环境</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>0</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>地质工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>地质工程</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>测绘与遥感科学系</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>081600测绘科学与技术</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>01大地测量学与测量工程；02摄影测量与遥感；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>085700资源与环境</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>0</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>测绘工程；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>140400遥感科学与技术</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>02遥感探测技术；03遥感信息工程；04遥感应用）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>地理信息系</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>081600测绘科学与技术</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>03地图制图学与地理信息工程；）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>140400遥感科学与技术</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>02遥感探测技术；03遥感信息工程；04遥感应用）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>085700资源与环境</span></span></strong><span><span>（</span><span>0</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>测绘工程；）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>四、报名时间与方式</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>—7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span><span>“中南大学2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日”网站报名，报名链接：<span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、活动</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>与方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>举办时间：</span><span>2025年7月18日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办方式：线下举办。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>2025年7月13</span></span><span><span>日前完成对报名学生的报名审查，学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得报名资格。取得报名资格且有意愿参加我院暑期招生宣讲开放日活动的学生，加入2025年地信院暑期招生宣讲开放日QQ群：365838850；并于现场签到时提交如下材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）本人身份证和学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）个人简历。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、具体活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）活动时间：</span><span>2025年7月18日全天</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）活动安排：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>①7月18日8:00-8:30：学生报到（中南大学潇湘校区地球科学楼127#，）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②7月18日9:00-10:30：学院组织开放日开营仪式、招生政策宣讲、参观国家级科普基地-地质博物馆等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③7月18日11:00-18:00：学院各招生宣讲单位组织，含与招生导师面对面交流、学术交流、参观实验室等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④7月18日18:00，本次开放日活动结束。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、其他说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加开放日活动资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）活动期间，请注意保证安全问题，如人身、财产、交通安全等，必须遵守中南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）本次活动食宿自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：葛老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0731-88879331</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>727710934@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：中南大学潇湘校区地球科学楼</span><span>105#</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"43597c401cd69f235afd84d3feab382a1f05992e0e9757d8bfca6be3726b1010","textLength":1574,"sourceSha256":"2d9d67c518b5519e6519768279e83fd7ed54cdb11c84ec3eea11856454523136","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6342fad03d77bb949873","title":"2025年中南大学地球科学与信息物理学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.592334+00:00"}
